# Gradle Build Rules

## IPv6 Fix
ALWAYS use `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS=-Djava.net.preferIPv4Stack=true` before any Gradle command.
This machine has broken IPv6; all DNS resolution must prefer IPv4.

## Stale Lock Fix
If Gradle hangs:
1. Kill java: `taskkill /F /IM java.exe`
2. Delete F:\Android\Gradle\caches\modules-2\modules-2.lock
3. Delete daemon registry files
4. Retry with --no-daemon --offline

